    dcterms:identifier "Figure2.27" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Increase in apex predator biomass of three no-fishing zones (NFZs)" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/NXS24-Figure2.28> a ipbes:Illustration ;
    ipbes:hasDescription """(A) The 10 percent quantiles (10 per cent of the cells with the highest species richness values). (B) Hotpots (green-coloured regions) based on the 10 per cent quantiles in panel (A).

Mapping impacts: Population numbers (Sims et al., 2023) and income level data (World Bank, 2023m) were used to calculate how many people with which income level live within the hotspot areas. Income levels are not purchasing power parity corrected (World Bank, 2023n). Summary statistics were calculated to identify the percentage of total terrestrial and""" ;
    dcterms:identifier "Figure2.28" ;
