    skos:prefLabel "Association between actors participating in the nexus and how these vary" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/NXS24-Figure4.9> a ipbes:Illustration ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Panel (A): Number of reviewed studies mentioning different categories of enablers or barriers (n= 202). Panel (B): Percentage of the reviewed studies mentioning each of the enabler or barriers across the different nexus challenges." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Figure4.9" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Factors influencing the governance of nexus interactions." .

