    skos:prefLabel "Organization of the Nexus Assessment chapters." .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/NXS24-Figure5.1.1> a ipbes:Illustration ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "(A) As defined by the United Nations Environment Assembly (UNEP/EA.5/Res.5, 2022); figure used under licence CC BY-NC 4.0. (B) The International Union for the Conservation of Nature (IUCN, 2020b); figure used under licence CC BY-NC 4.0." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Figure5.1.1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Nature-based solutions." .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/NXS24-Figure5.1.10> a ipbes:Illustration ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "See Chapter 4, section 4.2.4 and Table 4.4 for descriptions of the policy categories." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Figure5.1.10" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Classification of each of the 14 biodiversity response options as an action or management (direct implementation on the ground), a policy instrument that guides action and/or an enabler that facilitates or improves an action, management or policy." .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/NXS24-Figure5.1.11> a ipbes:Illustration ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "See Chapter 4, section 4.2.5 and Table 4.6 for descriptions of the enablers and barriers." ;
