<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/NXS24-Figure5.3.15> a ipbes:Illustration ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Left photo: Milpa showing the three sisters – maize, beans and squash. Right photo: Raised wooden bed structures locally known as ka’an che’ located near the household kitchen and to grow frequently used species." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Figure5.3.15" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Mayan food systems in the Yucatan peninsula." .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/NXS24-Figure5.3.16> a ipbes:Illustration ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Left photo: paddy fields and locally grown rice. Right photo: wild harvested foods." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Figure5.3.16" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Kelabit community food heritage in Borneo." .

