    ipbes:hasDescription "Themes were identified through word searches of national pathways across the five nexus elements and “other”, which often included cross-cutting actions. The relative size of the box indicates the number of countries including the themes in their pathways. Abbreviations: RGSS – restoring grasslands and shrublands and savannahs; RSV – resilience to stress and vulnerabilities." ;
