    ipbes:hasDescription "Contributions from Akiwiy, Cilo, Hanna Deng, Sumi · Dongi, Collins Handa, Aslak Holmberg, A-Jiao Lin, Ongoo · Osay, Loupa Pius, Kamal Kumar Rai, Francisco J. Rosado-May, José Tek, Nick Roskruge, and Yu-Hua Yang are gratefully acknowledged. Please see online Supplementary material 1.1, Table SM.1.1 for the full version of the table." ;
