<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/NXS24-A3-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/NXS24-2.4.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/NXS24-2.4.3>,
